lculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Putnam County runs from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those 75 years. On the middle in 2025, January to February came in at 47% of normal and August to September at 52%. In 2026 so far, January to February sat at 45% on the middle. Grid 23274 had its driest year in 1963 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
